# Performance

- List endpoints must paginate; enforce max page size
- Avoid query-in-loop; batch with `IN` / joins / include/select
- Avoid N+1; shape Prisma queries with `select`/`include`
- For large exports, stream responses (`StreamableFile`) instead of loading into memory
- Plan DB connection pool sizing for multi-instance deployments

Detail: [docs/20-performance.md](../docs/20-performance.md)

